42 &#x003bc;g bid salmeterol</td><td valign="top" align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">12 weeks, parallel</td><td valign="top" align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">405</td><td valign="top" align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02013;</td><td valign="top" align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">NS</td><td valign="top" align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">NS</td><td valign="top" align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">6MWD: NS</td><td valign="top" align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02013;</td><td valign="top" align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02013;</td></tr></tbody></table><table-wrap-foot><fn id="tfn7-copd-5-057"><p><bold>Abbreviations:</bold> FEV<bold>1</bold>, forced expiratory volume in 1 second; FVC, forced vital capacity; PCE, progressive cycle ergometry; CWR, constant work rate; 6MWD, 6 minute walk distance; SWT, shuttle walk test; TTE, Time to exhaustion (for PCE); NS, not significant.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></floats-group></article>